 "title": "Doors of Stone",
 "kind": "hero",
 "seed": 4505,
 "intro": [
  "The Lockstone, the seal on the Wound, was cast by the Sunken Forge, and the Concord stopped paying for its upkeep forty years ago. Aldous rides to the mountain gates with Orrin's warning and a small escort.",
  "Below the Stonevow Gate lives a smith the Forge threw out for talking to outsiders: Tobbin Greave. If anyone will speak for the Concord at the gate, it is him.",
  "The border wardens of Ironmarshal Dask Vell guard the road. They call your people debtors, and they have been told what to do with debtors."
 ],
 "outro": [
  {
   "if": {
    "flag": "learned_lockstone"
   },
   "text": [
    "The wardens fall back behind the rock. Dask Vell's last words stay with Aldous on the road down: the runes on the Lockstone have not been recut in forty years, and the Forge has been begging the Concord for the silver to do it.",
    "From the walls a runesmith shouts down: \"You owe us forty years. Pay it in your own blood.\" The gates do not open."
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": [
    "The wardens fall back behind the rock. From the walls a runesmith shouts down: \"You owe us forty years. Pay it in your own blood.\"",
    "The gates do not open."
   ]
  }
